<BaseLayout title="About Rooted Smile">
  <h1>About Rooted Smile</h1>
  <p>Rooted Smile was created for people who needed oral care that felt calm, earthy, and truly clean.</p>
  <p>So many toothpastes burn, foam too much, or leave a strong mint “zing.” We wanted a ritual that sensitive mouths could actually enjoy.</p>
  <p>Our blends are inspired by traditional, earth-based ingredients and made in small batches.</p>
